Package: eyetrajectories
Title: R Interface for Functional Eye-Tracking Trajectories
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Stefanos", "Balaskas", email = "s.balaskas@ac.upatras.gr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an experimental R interface to the Python package
    'eyetrajectoriespy' for continuous eye-tracking trajectory analysis.
    Supports explicit conversion of R long-format gaze samples, simulated
    trajectories, functional principal component analysis, and selected
    research workflows. Python is initialized only when a bridge function
    is used. This package is not a native R implementation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/stefanosbalaskas/eyetrajectories
BugReports: https://github.com/stefanosbalaskas/eyetrajectories/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    reticulate (>= 1.41)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
